{"id": "guides/guilds", "type": "guides", "slug": "guilds", "title": "Guilds", "summary": "Create or join a guild of up to 30 awakened from rank D: earn guild points in rifts, upgrade perks and buy boosts.", "rarity": null, "is_overview": false, "image": null, "infobox": [], "sections": [{"id": "overview", "heading": "Overview", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "text": "A guild is a team of up to 30 awakened (3 officers at most). You can create one from rank D . Name: 3 to 20 characters, tag: 2 to 4. Renaming costs 10,000 shards. Recruitment can be Open, Apply, Closed .", "html": "<p>A guild is a team of up to <strong>30 awakened</strong> (3 officers at most). You can create one from <strong>rank D</strong>. Name: 3 to 20 characters, tag: 2 to 4. Renaming costs 10,000 shards. Recruitment can be <strong>Open, Apply, Closed</strong>.</p>"}]}, {"id": "emblem", "heading": "Emblem", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "text": "The leader draws the guild's emblem: 12 shapes , 24 symbols , 24 colours or any colour, a pattern on the field (solid, split, stripes, band, edges, gradient) in a second colour, a simple, double or thick border, the symbol's size and rotation, a halo, and a small second symbol on a badge. The emblem shows in the guild window, the rankings, the guild browser and the invitations.", "html": "<p>The leader draws the guild's emblem: <strong>12 shapes</strong>, <strong>24 symbols</strong>, 24 colours or any colour, a pattern on the field (solid, split, stripes, band, edges, gradient) in a second colour, a simple, double or thick border, the symbol's size and rotation, a halo, and a small second symbol on a badge. The emblem shows in the guild window, the rankings, the guild browser and the invitations.</p>"}, {"type": "p", "text": "", "html": "<p><img alt=\"Emblem: diamond\" src=\"/games/overrank/guilds/emblem-diamond.webp\"/> <img alt=\"Emblem: circle\" src=\"/games/overrank/guilds/emblem-circle.webp\"/> <img alt=\"Emblem: crest\" src=\"/games/overrank/guilds/emblem-crest.webp\"/> <img alt=\"Emblem: square\" src=\"/games/overrank/guilds/emblem-square.webp\"/> <img alt=\"Emblem: seal\" src=\"/games/overrank/guilds/emblem-seal.webp\"/> <img alt=\"Emblem: ring\" src=\"/games/overrank/guilds/emblem-ring.webp\"/> <img alt=\"Emblem: hexagon\" src=\"/games/overrank/guilds/emblem-hexagon.webp\"/> <img alt=\"Emblem: shield\" src=\"/games/overrank/guilds/emblem-shield.webp\"/> <img alt=\"Emblem: star\" src=\"/games/overrank/guilds/emblem-star.webp\"/> <img alt=\"Emblem: octagon\" src=\"/games/overrank/guilds/emblem-octagon.webp\"/> <img alt=\"Emblem: banner\" src=\"/games/overrank/guilds/emblem-banner.webp\"/> <img alt=\"Emblem: wings\" src=\"/games/overrank/guilds/emblem-wings.webp\"/></p>"}]}, {"id": "grades", "heading": "Grades", "blocks": [{"type": "table", "headers": ["Grade", "Invite", "Kick", "Promote", "Withdraw from the bank"], "rows": [[{"text": "Leader"}, {"text": "yes"}, {"text": "yes"}, {"text": "yes"}, {"text": "yes"}], [{"text": "Officer"}, {"text": "yes"}, {"text": "yes"}, {"text": "no"}, {"text": "yes"}], [{"text": "Member"}, {"text": "no"}, {"text": "no"}, {"text": "no"}, {"text": "no"}]], "html": "<table><thead><tr><th>Grade</th><th>Invite</th><th>Kick</th><th>Promote</th><th>Withdraw from the bank</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Leader</td><td>yes</td><td>yes</td><td>yes</td><td>yes</td></tr><tr><td>Officer</td><td>yes</td><td>yes</td><td>no</td><td>yes</td></tr><tr><td>Member</td><td>no</td><td>no</td><td>no</td><td>no</td></tr></tbody></table>"}]}, {"id": "guild-points", "heading": "Guild points", "blocks": [{"type": "p", "text": "Every dungeon you clear gives points to your guild:", "html": "<p>Every dungeon you clear gives points to your guild:</p>"}, {"type": "table", "headers": ["Dungeon rank", "Points"], "rows": [[{"text": "Rank E", "href": "/en/w/overrank/ranks/e"}, {"text": "5"}], [{"text": "Rank D", "href": "/en/w/overrank/ranks/d"}, {"text": "10"}], [{"text": "Rank C", "href": "/en/w/overrank/ranks/c"}, {"text":